# The Python backend was fully retired — Rust took over (see `core-rs/` +
# `apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/runner.rs`). This folder is kept locally for
# reference / parity sweeps only; the repo no longer tracks it and the desktop
# app no longer wires it in (the Python dispatch + its localStorage opt-in were
# removed). To compare behaviour, run the Python sidecar standalone from inside
# `split-python/`.
